    "zh": "一个 matplotlib 样式文件加一个出图脚本：置信带曲线、带散点和显著性的分组柱、相关性热图，180mm 宽，导出可编辑 SVG/PDF。",
    "en": "One matplotlib style plus one script: CI-band curves, grouped bars with points and significance, a correlation heatmap; 180 mm wide, editable SVG/PDF."
  },
  "tags": [
    "matplotlib",
    "nature",
    "okabe-ito",
    "色盲友好",
    "多面板",
